            "review_title": "Review at Matsuri Japanese Restaurant - Vincom Thao Dien",
            "review_text": "Veronica Morra\nDa Lat, Vietnam491 contributions\n0\nBest Japanese dining in six years. Maybe ever...\nMar 2026 • Solo\nFirst time right this Japanese Restaurant. From the ambiance, service, good presentation, portions and quality, absolutely 10 stars. . Everything was timely and very fresh and flavorful. I look forward to coming back. Highly recommend. Best Japanese so far (6 years) in Vietnam. The octopus salad with passion fruit sauce was amazing. So were the sea urchin and the scallops.\nRead more\nWritten March 28, 2026",
