            "review_title": "Review at Matsuri Japanese Restaurant - Vincom Thao Dien",
            "review_text": "James O\nCork, Ireland1223 contributions\n0\nSuperb Sushi\nDec 2024 • Couples\nDont be put off by the entrance to this restaurant. Inside it is a bright, pleasent establishment with an extensive and varied menu of value for money fare. However, it is the service that outshines all. We were served by Taung (apologies as this young ladies name is probably wrong) that said she is a pleasant and funny young lady with good English and interpersonal skills which added greatly to our experience. \nThe menu is easy to follow, and we ordered a platter of sushi on the recommendation of our server, which we found to be well prepared and attractively presented. There are also vaying sashimi platters on offer to tantalise your palette.\nWe further enjoyed some very inventive non alcoholic drinks with our meal.\nI would most definitely return and highly recommend it to you.\nRead more\nWritten December 16, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
